WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:00.943
- All right, y'all.

00:00:00.943 --> 00:00:02.300
You know that we can't close up an hour

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.100
without one last feel-good story.

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:05.737
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:05.737 --> 00:00:08.551
(upbeat music)

00:00:08.551 --> 00:00:10.790
A 12-year-old artist
is helping young black

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:12.950
and brown girls gain
confidence with a series

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:15.860
of coloring books that
include powerful affirmations.

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:17.320
She goes by Summer Strawberry

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:19.410
and says after experiencing bullying,

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:22.030
she wants other kids to have
the tools to get through it.

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:22.863
Let's say hi to the author

00:00:22.863 --> 00:00:25.128
of "Black, Brown, and
"Beautiful," Summer Strawberry,

00:00:25.128 --> 00:00:27.283
along with her daddy, Everett.

00:00:28.446 --> 00:00:30.104
Hi.

00:00:30.104 --> 00:00:31.000
- Hi, Kelly.
- Hello, hi.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:31.880
- How you doing?

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:33.970
- Oh my gosh, y'all are both so cute.

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:35.640
I'm gonna lead with that.

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:38.780
Also, Summer, tell us more
about how this all got started.

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:41.220
- Yes, so I am black,
brown, and beautiful.

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:44.080
I'm a winner, I'm a
leader, and I am fearless.

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:45.080
- [Kelly] I love it.

00:00:45.967 --> 00:00:48.160
(crowd clapping)

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:52.160
- I just started when I was very little,

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:54.010
and I started drawing very young,

00:00:54.010 --> 00:00:55.780
and that was around three years old.

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:58.520
And then I started
getting into digital art

00:00:58.520 --> 00:01:00.170
when I was around eight years old,

00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:02.290
and now I use my iPad Pro.

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:05.420
And so one day, my dad asked why

00:01:05.420 --> 00:01:07.343
I wasn't drawing black or brown girls,

00:01:08.281 --> 00:01:09.114
and I didn't even realize.

00:01:09.114 --> 00:01:11.180
And I was surprised when he asked me that,

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:13.600
and I thought it was
really hard drawing them

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:17.100
because of all the features and the hair.

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:18.910
And once I gave it a try,

00:01:18.910 --> 00:01:21.817
I realized it wasn't as
hard as I thought it was.

00:01:21.817 --> 00:01:24.400
- And so it reminded me of the
black doll, white doll test

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:27.640
done in 1939, in which
the psychologist asked

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:31.650
the black children which
doll was the prettiest,

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:33.600
which was the nicest,
which was the smartest.

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:36.020
And they all chose the white doll.

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:39.030
And then he asked them
which doll was the bad doll,

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:40.610
which doll was the ugly doll,

00:01:40.610 --> 00:01:43.210
and the black children
chose the black doll.

00:01:43.210 --> 00:01:46.480
And so to me, it was like more
of a subconscious self-hate

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:47.360
that was coming about.

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:49.790
And so I asked Summer to go ahead

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:52.270
and remove a lot of
the color from her art,

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:54.220
and what she was left with was line art

00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:55.760
that represented now a coloring book.

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:56.593
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:56.593 --> 00:01:58.220
That's, I didn't even know about that.

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:01.790
What you just talked
about; that's horrible.

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:03.580
But Summer, you include affirmations

00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:04.440
in the book as well, right?

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:05.980
That's super important.

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:08.540
- Yes, because affirmations is how I dealt

00:02:08.540 --> 00:02:11.840
with my bullying and how
I overcame my bullying.

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:13.990
And I was bullied from the
fourth through sixth grade,

00:02:13.990 --> 00:02:16.210
and kids would ask why
my fingers were so long,

00:02:16.210 --> 00:02:18.030
and they would compare
their fingers to mine.

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:19.720
And I was also bullied about my tooth

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:23.040
because once I lost my tooth,
it grew in pretty crooked.

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:25.210
And the affirmations
have definitely helped

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:27.680
me overcome my bullying.

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:30.340
And now I'm coming out
with a second coloring book

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:32.810
called "Glow Up," and it'll be translated

00:02:32.810 --> 00:02:35.690
in English, Spanish, Portuguese, French,

00:02:35.690 --> 00:02:37.158
Haitian, Creole, and Swahili.

00:02:37.158 --> 00:02:37.991
- [Kelly] Wow.

00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:40.750
And we'll also have two
activity pages included.

00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:44.520
So one is talking about the
transatlantic slave trade.

00:02:44.520 --> 00:02:46.370
And one is another one where

00:02:46.370 --> 00:02:48.725
you could write your own affirmations.

00:02:48.725 --> 00:02:50.017
(crowd cheering)

00:02:50.017 --> 00:02:53.017
- That's such a cool thing to
be doing at such a young age.

00:02:53.017 --> 00:02:54.490
Girl, I'm so proud of you.

00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:56.040
Thank you so much, Summer.

00:02:56.040 --> 00:02:57.120
Thank you, Everett.

00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:59.662
I'm liking y'all's post right now.

00:02:59.662 --> 00:03:00.610
And that's not all.

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:03.070
Our season-long partner
Pilot Pin, makers of G2,

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:04.900
the go-to pin of the Kelly Clarkson show,

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:07.730
want to honor ultimate
overachievers just like y'all.

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:09.090
So they're gonna be writing you a check

00:03:09.090 --> 00:03:10.090
for a thousand dollars.

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:11.066
How's that sound?

00:03:11.066 --> 00:03:11.899
(crowd cheering)

00:03:11.899 --> 00:03:12.732
- Oh, wow.

00:03:12.732 --> 00:03:16.250
(Kelly laughing)

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:17.750
- [Kelly] Thank y'all so much.

